objectClasses: ( 2.16.840.1.113894.746875.2.1.4 NAME 'orclDASsubscribercontainer' DESC 'Oracle DAS Subscriber Container' SUP top STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn ) MAY ( orclaci $ orclentrylevelaci ) )
objectClasses: ( 2.16.840.1.113894.746875.2.1.5 NAME 'orclAuxiliaryGUID' DESC 'Oracle Auxiliary GUID' SUP top AUXILIARY MAY ( orclguid $ orclaci ) )
